{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","卡列琳娜"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长控制敌人的法师，同时自己还能对被控制的敌人造成额外的伤害。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","比冰雪更无情的战场啊……"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","A battlefield more merciless than the frigid winter."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","烛火也能够点亮寒冬"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Even the candle's warmth can pierce through the winter cold."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","请赐予我们永恒的宁静……"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Please, grant us eternal peace."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","终将归于寂静……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Everything returns... to stillness..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","明亮而又温暖，这是胜利的感觉吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Is this what victory feels like?"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","寒风呼啸的夜晚，需要一点烛光吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","下雪了，我已经没有能融化她的体温了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","热火和体温似乎一样的寒冷。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","是老鼠先生吗？在哪里，不在了，去睡吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这样温暖的东西，我会永远保存……"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","礼物上仿佛带着体温……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好温暖的地方……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我想再多待一阵子……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","热热的，甜甜的，很好喝……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今天的雪花很温柔"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","请喝一碗热汤吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好温暖啊……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","烟花很美丽"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","据说修道院的附近的雪原上生活着一只雪怪，有三只会发光的眼睛。卡列琳娜因为好奇而去寻找雪怪的期间，说自己目击到雪怪的人数剧烈攀升。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","据大修道院中的修道者们说，后山的雪原上常常传来少女的哭泣声。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","成为亡灵后的卡列琳娜再也感觉不到寒冷，但她偶尔会怀念生病时，父母敷在她头上的热毛巾的触感。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜的姐姐们都陆续结婚离开了家中，只有哥哥一直陪伴着她，直到生命的尽头。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“亲爱的卡列琳娜，有了这些蜡烛，你晚上就再也不会因为怕黑而哭泣了。爱你的姐姐们。”——来自卡列琳娜至今藏在烛台下的纸条。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜有时会称呼那个在墓室里保护自己的人偶为“哥哥”。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据修道院中的老者说，在大雪封山的天气，修道院附近会有幽灵出没。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜的家族与统领公国的大公家族有过姻亲，他们的祖辈时常往来。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜生前在修道院进修过，如果早已沉眠在地底的修士可以做出评判，他们会说，卡列琳娜是一位安静虔诚的贵族小姐。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","修道院的大主教知道卡列琳娜的身份，会在下雪的日子偷偷保留几盏彻夜不熄的灯火，以给卡列琳娜引路。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","好香啊，茶壶先生泡的茶闻起来有股花的香味……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411270.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 卡列琳娜"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","东白山领"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","警戒！陌生信号！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411290.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","铐兰 & 卡列琳娜"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","好温暖的地方……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415126.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","热热的，甜甜的，很好喝……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415127.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","今天的雪花很温柔"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415437.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","请喝一碗热汤吧"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415438.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","好温暖啊……"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415613.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","烟花很美丽"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415614.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜"]]}